e il male! Meguru è sempre allegra, ma ogni tanto è fin troppo vivace, mentre Sumire non è abiutata a stare a contatto con altre persone. Nonostante le loro differenze, però, collaborando insieme, iniziano ad aprirsi l'una con l'altra..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Twin Angel Break","overview":"Amatsuki Meguru is a girl who innocently aspires to be a hero of justice and the cool Kisaragi Sumire who grew up in the strict Kisaragi household... The two girls who are in their 3rd year of middle school end up getting orders from a mysterious hedgehog named Miruku-chan and turn into Twin Angels in order to fight evil! Meguru is always cheerful but sometimes a bit too forceful. Meanwhile, Sumire isn’t accustomed with being around others. Despite their differences, as they work together, they start opening up to each other."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"チイチ島から東京の聖チェリーヌ学院に編入してきた天月めぐる。たくさんの友達ができるなか、ミステリアスな少女・如月すみれとはなかなか仲良くなれずにいた。そんな中、学校のイベントで起きた事件をきっかけにめぐるは謎のハリネズミ・みるくちゃんにスカウトされて“ツインエンジェルBREAK”に変身することに……!?"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e8NfFP7rSc0tzqV6jBbHAFcYbrt.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e8NfFP7rSc0tzqV6jBbHAFcYbrt.png","language":"ja","width":560,"height":290}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/df1hhC7He2N5cnP2hRN0RzWn9Il.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/df1hhC7He2N5cnP2hRN0RzWn9Il.jpg","language":"xx","width":640,"height":960}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y84i6gI1luaHXGqr7SS6kTfg3p7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y84i6gI1luaHXGqr7SS6kTfg3p7.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrPk4ikR30jVI1Ls1qMnBHsR3UG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lrPk4ikR30jVI1Ls1qMnBHsR3UG.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e8NfFP7rSc0tzqV6jBbHAFcYbrt.